 Supplement\n\nGibco™\n\n# IMDM, GlutaMAX™ Supplement\n\nIMDM (Iscove's Modified Dulbecco's Medium) is well suited for rapidly proliferating, high-density cell cultures, including Jurkat, COS-7, and macrophage cells.Read more\n\nCatalog Number  | Quantity\n--- | ---\n31980030Image: Promo Image  | 500 mL\n31980097Image: Promo Image  | 10 x 500 mL\n\n2 Options\n\nCatalog number 31980030\n\nPrice (INR)\n\n4,020.00\n\nOnline offer\n\nEnds: 31-Dec-2026\n\n5,742.00\n\nSave 1,722.00 (30%)\n\nEach\n\nImage: Promo ImagePromotion available\n\nIn stock\n\nThis IMDM is modified as follows:\n\nWith: GlutaMAX™, Phenol Red\n\nWithout: α-thioglycerol, 2-mercaptoethanol\n\nThe complete formulation is available.\n\nUsing IMDM\n\nIMDM, a modification of Dulbecco's Modified Eagle Medium, includes selenium as well as additional amino acids and vitamins. In addition, this unique medium lacks iron, with potassium nitrate replacing ferric nitrate. IMDM with GlutaMAX™ supplement minimizes toxic ammonia build-up and improves cell viability and growth in an easy-to-use format. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n<table id=\"e1\"> (https://documents.thermofisher.com/TFS-Assets/LSG/Reference-Materials/bangalore-warehouse-stock-list.pdf)\nciteturn78search14 [wordlim: 200] Published: 6.7 years ago; <tr><td>21870076</td><td>RPMI 1640 Medium, no glutamine</td><td>500 mL</td></tr> ... <tr><td>31980030</td><td>IMDM, GlutaMAX Supplement</td><td>500 mL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>21063029</td><td>DMEM, high glucose, HEPES, no phenol red</td><td>500 mL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>21083027</td><td>Leibovitz's L-15 Medium, no phenol red</td><td>500 mL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>21127022</td><td>Ham's F-12K (Kaighn's) Medium</td><td>500 mL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>21127030</td><td>Ham's F-12K (Kaighn's) Medium</td><td>10 x 500 mL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>21475025</td><td>Fischer's Medium</td><td>500 mL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>21870076</td><td>RPMI 1640 Medium, no glutamine</td><td>500 mL</td></tr>\n<